  - m_Id: 2467484298436677
    m_Localized: "HEAVY"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298436678
    m_Localized: "ELECTRONIC"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298436679
    m_Localized: "DANCE"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298436680
    m_Localized: "GROOVE"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298436681
    m_Localized: "FUNKY"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298436682
    m_Localized: "SOULFUL"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298436683
    m_Localized: "JAZZY"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298436684
    m_Localized: "CATCHY POP"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298436685
    m_Localized: "ENERGETIC"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298436686
    m_Localized: "CHILL"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298436687
    m_Localized: "DREAMY"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298436688
    m_Localized: "DARK"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298436689
    m_Localized: "EXPERIMENTAL"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298436690
    m_Localized: "SELECT SONG"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298436691
    m_Localized: "CATALOG COMPLETE — every song completed"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298436692
    m_Localized: "COMPLETED"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298436693
    m_Localized: "SELECT SONG"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298436694
    m_Localized: "CROUCH"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437694
    m_Localized: "One lonely melody? This is counterpoint on strike!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437695
    m_Localized: "That bass is repeating a year. And failing every bar."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437696
    m_Localized: "So many tracks, and not one voice listens to the others!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437697
    m_Localized: "This harmony has weaker foundations than an inflatable organ."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437698
    m_Localized: "Where is the answer to the subject? Lost in the corridor?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437699
    m_Localized: "A filter is no substitute for modulation, however much it goes whee-whee."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437700
    m_Localized: "These voices only stay together because someone glued them."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437701
    m_Localized: "The kick keeps time. Everything else seems to misplace it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437702
    m_Localized: "This is no fugue: it is a theme looking for the exit."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437703
    m_Localized: "I looked for development. All I found was a repeat button."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437704
    m_Localized: "The bass supports the voices well... I resent having to certify it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437705
    m_Localized: "That entrance was well placed. Who taught the machine discipline?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437706
    m_Localized: "A simple structure beat me. Simple, but well built. How irritating."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437707
    m_Localized: "The layers fit. It is no counterpoint, but at least they avoid stepping on toes."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437708
    m_Localized: "I admit that tension resolved well. I shall record it in small print."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437709
    m_Localized: "The rhythm is solid. Unfortunately, so is the result."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437710
    m_Localized: "That imitation between instruments made sense. Who authorized it?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437711
    m_Localized: "I followed the bass to the end. Not one blunder. Suspicious."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437712
    m_Localized: "The chorus has impeccable logic. I would like to file a complaint."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437713
    m_Localized: "Few notes, good voice leading... I lost, but I found order."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437714
    m_Localized: "Case closed: stacking noises does not produce counterpoint."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437715
    m_Localized: "The whole building collapsed. The bass was meant to be a foundation, not a cushion!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437716
    m_Localized: "The chorus returned. Victory did not return with it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437717
    m_Localized: "A decent cadence might have helped. So might a miracle."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437718
    m_Localized: "The voices were not speaking. Now they can share the silence."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437719
    m_Localized: "Order, harmony, and one perfectly catalogued victory!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437720
    m_Localized: "That chord wanted resolution. It got defeat instead."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437721
    m_Localized: "The theme failed to develop. The disaster, however, flourished."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437722
    m_Localized: "Another loop for the failed exercises drawer!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437723
    m_Localized: "You may switch off the metronome. The verdict is in."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437724
    m_Localized: "IS THAT KICK KNOCKING AT THE DOOR OR DEMOLISHING THE HOUSE?!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437725
    m_Localized: "Everything sounds enormous! Even the shortage of ideas!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437726
    m_Localized: "Where are the contrasts? A locomotive has ironed this music flat!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437727
    m_Localized: "That crescendo climbs a long way to reach an empty chair."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437728
    m_Localized: "The melody should confront the bass, not hide under the carpet!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437729
    m_Localized: "What a timid entrance! Let the theme barge in shoulders first!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437730
    m_Localized: "The volume has muscles. Expression stayed in the changing room."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437731
    m_Localized: "The same rhythm again? Even storms find new ways to be furious!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437732
    m_Localized: "They compressed the drama until it fitted in a tin!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437733
    m_Localized: "That pause builds no tension. It sounds like someone hunting for a socket."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437734
    m_Localized: "That outburst had force! It knocked down me and nearly the music stand!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437735
    m_Localized: "THUNDER AND BLAST! The melody fought back. I respect notes with fists."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437736
    m_Localized: "I lost... but that contrast made me leap out of my chair. The chair is my witness!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437737
    m_Localized: "The bass has drive. It can be pleased: it drove me straight into defeat."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437738
    m_Localized: "That silence before the entrance... Yes, it worked. DO NOT MAKE ME REPEAT IT!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437739
    m_Localized: "The chorus has character. Insufferable character, but character!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437740
    m_Localized: "There was emotion under all that noise. I had to excavate, but it was there!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437741
    m_Localized: "That motif grew! Too much: it ran me over."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437742
    m_Localized: "The dynamics breathed. I am gasping now, but they breathed!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437743
    m_Localized: "I withdraw no complaint about the volume. I only admit the music had fire!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437744
    m_Localized: "VICTORY! Volume cannot do the composer's job!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437745
    m_Localized: "The kick hit hard. The theme should have struck first!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437746
    m_Localized: "That crescendo swelled until it burst. Musical confetti!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437747
    m_Localized: "Contrast has won! Someone explain it to the compressor!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437748
    m_Localized: "All that energy, only to finish like a drum without a skin!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437749
    m_Localized: "I won before that melody found its courage!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437750
    m_Localized: "The chorus demanded power. It needed a reason to shout!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437751
    m_Localized: "That settles it! Drama has defeated the blender!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437752
    m_Localized: "A hundred speakers could not save a theme that tiptoes!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437753
    m_Localized: "A forceful ending! Mine. Theirs is still looking for the button."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437754
    m_Localized: "That motif is a seed. Why serve it without planting it?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437755
    m_Localized: "Another layer of sound will not give this idea substance."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437756
    m_Localized: "The bass and melody live like neighbours who never say hello."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437757
    m_Localized: "This rhythm needs a syncopation. Or very strong coffee."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437758
    m_Localized: "They varnished the orchestration before building the table."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437759
    m_Localized: "Why rush to the chorus? Is dinner waiting?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437760
    m_Localized: "The theme returns untouched. Not a wrinkle from doing any work!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437761
    m_Localized: "This accompaniment is so light a sneeze could carry it away."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437762
    m_Localized: "Harmony offers a door. The song prefers circling the landing."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437763
    m_Localized: "All that outward polish, and the motif is still in pyjamas."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437764
    m_Localized: "They developed the motif sensibly. A pity for my bad mood."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437765
    m_Localized: "That cross-rhythm had substance. It tied my victory in knots."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437766
    m_Localized: "The inner voices were good. Yes, I listen to the middle ones too."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437767
    m_Localized: "The harmony knew where it was going. I was heading for victory, but took a wrong turn."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437768
    m_Localized: "I admit the theme's return was well prepared. Irritatingly well prepared."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437769
    m_Localized: "The texture had weight. All of it landed on me."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437770
    m_Localized: "That variation was clever. The defeat seems less well written."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437771
    m_Localized: "Those chords had warmth. No, I am not asking for a hug."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437772
    m_Localized: "An economical melody, well used. My complaint has gone over budget."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437773
    m_Localized: "The ending gathered every idea. And my victory too, apparently."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437774
    m_Localized: "Substance won. The varnish can go back in the tin."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437775
    m_Localized: "The motif never grew. We harvested precisely one crumb."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437776
    m_Localized: "A solid victory! The opposing accompaniment still needs scaffolding."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437777
    m_Localized: "All those repetitions, and not one variation worth the journey!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437778
    m_Localized: "The bass went its own way. It reached defeat all by itself."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437779
    m_Localized: "The race to the chorus is over. There was no prize."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437780
    m_Localized: "A rhythm with two legs walks better than one with a single crutch!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437781
    m_Localized: "The texture made a bulky parcel. Nothing inside the box."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437782
    m_Localized: "I won through development. A job the loop had left until tomorrow."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437783
    m_Localized: "Matter closed. That harmony needs proper foundations and less glitter."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437784
    m_Localized: "That kick entered the drawing room in muddy boots."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437785
    m_Localized: "The melody needs air. The compressor put it in a corset."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437786
    m_Localized: "Where is the rubato? Even the curtains move more freely."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437787
    m_Localized: "Those ornaments look like sugar tipped straight from the sack."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437788
    m_Localized: "All that electronic sustain, and not one well-phrased sigh."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437789
    m_Localized: "The voice slides between notes like a spoon on an empty plate."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437790
    m_Localized: "Such delicate cymbals. They served the crockery with a shovel."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437791
    m_Localized: "That accompaniment steps on the melody and still asks it to dance."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437792
    m_Localized: "A nocturne under those lights? Not even a moth could sleep."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437793
    m_Localized: "The notes arrive on time. Grace missed the carriage."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437794
    m_Localized: "That phrase breathed tastefully. I fear I have lost elegantly."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437795
    m_Localized: "The bass was discreet and effective. Manners I did not expect to find here."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437796
    m_Localized: "There was a lovely nuance. I heard it before making this face."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437797
    m_Localized: "The melody had cantabile. How inconsiderate of my prejudices."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437798
    m_Localized: "That expressive delay was well judged. The defeat was far too punctual."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437799
    m_Localized: "I admit the ornament enhanced the phrase. It need not have embellished my defeat too."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437800
    m_Localized: "The texture left room for the voice. I would have sat there, had I not fallen first."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437801
    m_Localized: "That chord had tenderness. Please do not announce it with a kick drum."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437802
    m_Localized: "The pulse was flexible. My disapproval has had to bend too."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437803
    m_Localized: "The ending was delicate. It almost had the courtesy not to humiliate me."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437804
    m_Localized: "Nuance won. You may remove the boots from the drawing room."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437805
    m_Localized: "The melody needed to breathe. Now it has all the silence it wanted."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437806
    m_Localized: "Such a stiff defeat. The metronome must be proud."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437807
    m_Localized: "The ornament failed to cover the emptiness. It merely framed it in lace."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437808
    m_Localized: "A victory without raising my voice. Do try it sometime."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437809
    m_Localized: "That intrusive accompaniment may escort defeat to the door."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437810
    m_Localized: "Sensitivity cannot be purchased with reverb. What a revelation."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437811
    m_Localized: "I have won. The plate has finally stopped fighting the spoon."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437812
    m_Localized: "So many sliding notes, and not one landed gracefully."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437813
    m_Localized: "One final recommendation: less hammering on the imaginary piano, more music."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437814
    m_Localized: "That entrance calls for a fanfare, not an ambitious toaster!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437815
    m_Localized: "That choir is so small I could summon it with a teaspoon."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437816
    m_Localized: "A chorus should proclaim something. This one announces its own return."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437817
    m_Localized: "Such solemnity! The coronation of a bicycle bell."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437818
    m_Localized: "The echo answers more confidently than the lead singer."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437819
    m_Localized: "That bass walks as though carrying a tray of jellies."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437820
    m_Localized: "The voice takes so many turns it has forgotten the aria."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437821
    m_Localized: "They have confused grandeur with switching on every trumpet at once."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437822
    m_Localized: "Where is the dialogue between soloist and ensemble? I hear only a shouting meeting."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437823
    m_Localized: "That cadence needs ceremony. Not an endless queue of effects."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437824
    m_Localized: "The chorus gathers the voices well. They had the insolence to sound majestic."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437825
    m_Localized: "That entrance had authority. It made me stand before I lost."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437826
    m_Localized: "The bass supported the whole ensemble. Work worthy of payment, regrettably."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437827
    m_Localized: "I found nobility in that melody. Who let it in without an invitation?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437828
    m_Localized: "The alternating voices worked. Even my protest waited its turn."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437829
    m_Localized: "That climax had splendour. I refuse to order it a crown."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437830
    m_Localized: "The voice ornamented sensibly. Not with a watering can, as I feared."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437831
    m_Localized: "The rhythm had a convincing march. It paraded me straight into defeat."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437832
    m_Localized: "I admit the ending was resounding. So was my groan."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437833
    m_Localized: "This ensemble breathes as one. Very well. Nobody shout hallelujah yet."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437834
    m_Localized: "Sound the trumpets! The in-tune ones, preferably!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437835
    m_Localized: "Grandeur has triumphed. The toaster may return to the kitchen."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437836
    m_Localized: "That choir proclaimed nothing. Except unanimous defeat."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437837
    m_Localized: "The fanfare ran out of breath. The verdict still has lungs!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437838
    m_Localized: "They crowned volume and dethroned melody. A predictable result!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437839
    m_Localized: "A solemn victory! Reserve a small chair for that chorus."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437840
    m_Localized: "The voice sought glory. It found an unflattering ending."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437841
    m_Localized: "That bass could not even support the concert programme!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437842
    m_Localized: "The ceremony is over. You may pick the effects up off the floor."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437843
    m_Localized: "An ovation for harmony! The smoke machine has had enough applause."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437844
    m_Localized: "The chorus again? Surprise must be stuck in traffic."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437845
    m_Localized: "That silence promised a joke. All we got was more kick drum."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437846
    m_Localized: "Theme and answer wear the same hat. How do we tell them apart?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437847
    m_Localized: "The form is square. A pity music is not a footstool."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437848
    m_Localized: "That ending announces itself so often I have sent it an invitation."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437849
    m_Localized: "An unexpected modulation, please! Even the soup tureen can make a turn."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437850
    m_Localized: "The phrase asked a question. The next one answered with a yawn."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437851
    m_Localized: "That symmetry is impeccable. So is the symmetry of two closed doors."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437852
    m_Localized: "The bass makes the same joke every bar. We got it the first time."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437853
    m_Localized: "All that preparation, only to come in through the usual door!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437854
    m_Localized: "That accent surprised me. A well-placed joke; I get to be the audience."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437855
    m_Localized: "The form was neatly tied together. I tripped over it with complete dignity."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437856
    m_Localized: "That pause had wit. Apparently I was today's joke."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437857
    m_Localized: "The theme's return caught me smiling. Inadmissible evidence!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437858
    m_Localized: "A good answer to that phrase. My defence answered late."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437859
    m_Localized: "The dynamic play was lively. Victory skipped right out of my hands."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437860
    m_Localized: "That modulation was amusing. Not as amusing as my face when I heard it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437861
    m_Localized: "The ending knew how to keep us waiting. I was waiting to win, as it happens."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437862
    m_Localized: "The motif was small but shrewd. It picked my musical pocket."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437863
    m_Localized: "I admit the rhythm played well with expectations. Mine are on the floor."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437864
    m_Localized: "Surprise! A witless structure can still lose right on time."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437865
    m_Localized: "The theme returned unchanged. The result gave it something new!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437866
    m_Localized: "What a timely pause. I can finally celebrate in peace."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437867
    m_Localized: "The music had no turns. Victory still found its way."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437868
    m_Localized: "An ending announced twenty bars in advance. And they still look surprised!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437869
    m_Localized: "The phrase asked who would win. I kindly supplied the answer."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437870
    m_Localized: "The bass repeated its joke until it lost the humour and the match."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437871
    m_Localized: "Victory! A little wit dismantled that wardrobe full of choruses."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437872
    m_Localized: "I supplied the unexpected accent: right on the victory."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437873
    m_Localized: "Everything so neatly squared... A pity the result does not fit."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437874
    m_Localized: "The voice says one thing, the harmony another. What a madrigal of misunderstandings!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437875
    m_Localized: "That vocal effect is wearing a mask. Bring the real voice onstage!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437876
    m_Localized: "A dissonance should pierce the heart, not tickle the cable."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437877
    m_Localized: "Where is the gesture in the phrase? This declaims like an automatic door."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437878
    m_Localized: "The melody falls to its knees while the bass keeps mopping the floor!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437879
    m_Localized: "So many doubled vocals... Is this a choir or a hall of mirrors?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437880
    m_Localized: "The rhythm will not let the singer speak. Even servants interrupt less!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437881
    m_Localized: "That entrance needs intention, not a smoke curtain with pitch."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437882
    m_Localized: "They dressed emotion in effects and gave it no role."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437883
    m_Localized: "Basso continuo does not mean a bass that continually annoys!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437884
    m_Localized: "That harmonic turn served the expression. I acknowledge it, irritating though it is."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437885
    m_Localized: "The voice made a convincing gesture. I made the gesture of losing."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437886
    m_Localized: "That dissonance knew when to yield. My indignation is still rehearsing."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437887
    m_Localized: "The bass let the melody declaim. Courtesy I did not expect."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437888
    m_Localized: "There was theatre in that entrance. And I ended up backstage."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437889
    m_Localized: "I admit the voices conversed. They even agreed on how to defeat me."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437890
    m_Localized: "The effect highlighted emotion. It did not hide it. I must revise my complaint."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437891
    m_Localized: "That pause said something. Right now I would rather say very little."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437892
    m_Localized: "The phrase had dramatic direction. It led me to an undignified exit."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437893
    m_Localized: "The melody knew how to move us. Let the record show my grimace is expressive too."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437894
    m_Localized: "Curtain down! The artificial voice may remove its makeup."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437895
    m_Localized: "Expression won. The effects can be extras."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437896
    m_Localized: "The dissonance said nothing. Defeat was very eloquent."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437897
    m_Localized: "That bass has interrupted the aria for the last time!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437898
    m_Localized: "A short tragedy: the melody went onstage without intention."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437899
    m_Localized: "The doubled vocals may now share a single defeat."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437900
    m_Localized: "Victory! It takes no thirty filters to make a note speak."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437901
    m_Localized: "Emotion failed to appear. I won by artistic default!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437902
    m_Localized: "That ending asked for a dramatic gesture. I lowered the curtain on it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437903
    m_Localized: "Applause for the well-spoken phrase! Noise already had enough of an audience."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437904
    m_Localized: "What a discreet melody! It passed through my head without leaving an address."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437905
    m_Localized: "That chord returns so often we should charge it rent."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437906
    m_Localized: "The chorus is sticky. So is jam on a keyboard."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437907
    m_Localized: "They put sequins on a scale and called it a solo."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437908
    m_Localized: "Such conversation between instruments! They all say \u201cme\u201d at once."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437909
    m_Localized: "The theme promised wit. I assume the promise was not binding."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437910
    m_Localized: "That bridge is so short it cannot cross a puddle."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437911
    m_Localized: "The voice has so many touch-ups the original might have been a flute."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437912
    m_Localized: "A harmonic surprise! Oh, no. The same chord in a hat."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437913
    m_Localized: "So much rhythm to take such a lazy idea for a walk."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437914
    m_Localized: "The melody has wit. It beat me before I finished the insult. Bad manners!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437915
    m_Localized: "That instrumental answer was brilliant. I know: it left me without a comeback."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437916
    m_Localized: "The hook works. You may remove it from my wig now."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437917
    m_Localized: "Good harmonic surprise! My face performed an involuntary modulation."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437918
    m_Localized: "That bridge led somewhere. Unfortunately, to my competitive funeral."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437919
    m_Localized: "The arrangement had wit. I demand a rematch with less talent."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437920
    m_Localized: "The phrase was simple and neatly resolved. An offensively effective combination."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437921
    m_Localized: "That vocal dialogue made me laugh. Defeat is less amusing."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437922
    m_Localized: "I admit the rhythm has charm. Do not give it my seat as well."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437923
    m_Localized: "The chorus is memorable. Now I have to remember losing. Thanks for that."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437924
    m_Localized: "I won! That same chord can go back to looking for work."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437925
    m_Localized: "The hook failed to catch victory. Try an interesting note."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437926
    m_Localized: "What a surprise! The shortage of ideas had consequences."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437927
    m_Localized: "That solo went down the scale. I suppose it is leaving."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437928
    m_Localized: "The chorus will return. I shall have finished celebrating."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437929
    m_Localized: "All those touch-ups, and they could not tune the result!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437930
    m_Localized: "A lazy idea just lost to one that got up early."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437931
    m_Localized: "The bridge collapsed. Luckily, development had never stepped onto it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437932
    m_Localized: "Victory is mine! Anyone care to adopt that homeless melody?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437933
    m_Localized: "We can repeat the match. The song has plenty of experience repeating itself."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437934
    m_Localized: "Repeating a bass is an art. Making it shuffle in slippers is not."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437935
    m_Localized: "Each turn should add something. This one merely adds minutes."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437936
    m_Localized: "All the voices enter together. Can they not queue?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437937
    m_Localized: "The loop returns so empty it resembles a furniture-free removal van."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437938
    m_Localized: "Those chords know each other, but have nothing to discuss."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437939
    m_Localized: "A canon needs imitation. Here they merely imitate the copy button."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437940
    m_Localized: "A bass can be constant without becoming a sleeping clerk."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437941
    m_Localized: "They garnished the repetition with a cymbal. What a meagre feast."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437942
    m_Localized: "The progression completed a lap. Where is the new scenery?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437943
    m_Localized: "If the theme must return, let it bring some news!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437944
    m_Localized: "Each repetition added a detail. An impeccable inventory defeated me."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437945
    m_Localized: "The bass was steady and the voices grew. I cannot report sound construction as a crime."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437946
    m_Localized: "That staggered entrance had charm. Defeat reached me in stages."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437947
    m_Localized: "The progression supported the melody well. I wish it had supported me."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437948
    m_Localized: "The loop knew how to renew itself. My protest became repetitive."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437949
    m_Localized: "I admit the layers built tension. Meanwhile, I built up problems."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437950
    m_Localized: "The rhythmic variation was subtle. The consequence was quite obvious."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437951
    m_Localized: "That return made sense. My victory, however, never returned."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437952
    m_Localized: "They made the repeating bass sing. I dislike having my arguments stolen."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437953
    m_Localized: "The ending released the tension well. I still have some to release."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437954
    m_Localized: "Repetition was not the problem. Doing nothing with it was!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437955
    m_Localized: "The bass completed every lap. The music never left the garage."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437956
    m_Localized: "Victory! Now we can vary the facial expressions, at least."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437957
    m_Localized: "The voices entered together and left defeated as a group."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437958
    m_Localized: "That progression had places to go. They preferred a roundabout."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437959
    m_Localized: "The loop is still waiting for a new idea. I already have the trophy."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437960
    m_Localized: "Another layer fixed nothing. Boredom can be stacked too!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437961
    m_Localized: "The chorus brought no news. The result brings a big headline."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437962
    m_Localized: "A steady pattern needs alert voices. These are still looking for the alarm clock."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437963
    m_Localized: "We have our final cadence. That was easier than finding a variation!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437964
    m_Localized: "That melody wants to dance, and the kick has nailed its feet to the floor!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437965
    m_Localized: "Where is the emotional arc? I see only a ramp towards confetti."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437966
    m_Localized: "The timbres change costumes before learning the steps."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437967
    m_Localized: "That climax has plenty of cannons. Did anyone bring an emotion?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437968
    m_Localized: "The melody turns halfway and returns to the dressing room. What cowardly choreography!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437969
    m_Localized: "Those imitation strings sound like a blanket being pulled by two goats."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437970
    m_Localized: "The rhythm marches, but the theme wanted to waltz. Let them agree!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437971
    m_Localized: "An explosion is no resolution. Ask the scenery!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437972
    m_Localized: "The harmony has stayed so still they will remove it with the scenery."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437973
    m_Localized: "All that preparation for a climax that tiptoes in!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437974
    m_Localized: "That melody could soar. It flew over me, tutu and all."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437975
    m_Localized: "The climax was well earned. My victory, apparently, was not."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437976
    m_Localized: "That change of orchestral colour was beautiful. My face chose red."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437977
    m_Localized: "The rhythm invited dancing. I slipped with a certain dignity."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437978
    m_Localized: "There was a real emotional arc. I ended up dangling from its lowest point."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437979
    m_Localized: "The tension grew sensibly. My confidence failed to follow the score."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437980
    m_Localized: "The strings had warmth. Even coming from that suspicious box."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437981
    m_Localized: "That waltzing rhythm had charm. It need not have spun the standings around."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437982
    m_Localized: "The chorus unfolded the theme well. My defeat was spectacular too."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437983
    m_Localized: "I admit the ending was moving. The tear is from rage, obviously."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437984
    m_Localized: "Curtain! The melody was not ready for that leap."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437985
    m_Localized: "They fired every effect. The music was still waiting for rehearsal."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437986
    m_Localized: "Victory! An emotional arc cannot be built from a rising siren."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437987
    m_Localized: "The kick trod on the melody until it trampled the result!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437988
    m_Localized: "Those strings may return to the blanket drawer."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437989
    m_Localized: "A grand finale! A pity the song had prepared only the fireworks."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437990
    m_Localized: "The theme dared not dance. Defeat asked for its hand."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437991
    m_Localized: "Victory has orchestral colour. The loop has gone quite pale."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437992
    m_Localized: "The show is over. Confetti cannot take a bow on the melody's behalf."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437993
    m_Localized: "All that tension to go nowhere! I, at least, reached the podium."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437994
    m_Localized: "That rhythm is not galloping: it is waiting for a bus!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437995
    m_Localized: "Soloist and ensemble do the same thing. Were they given only one chair?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437996
    m_Localized: "The refrain returns without having gone anywhere. What a cheap trip!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437997
    m_Localized: "That texture will not change even if you open the window!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437998
    m_Localized: "The violin should fly. That synthesizer is queuing on the runway."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298437999
    m_Localized: "An insistent rhythm needs drive, not roots!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438000
    m_Localized: "Where is the contrast in the solo? Has it dressed as accompaniment?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438001
    m_Localized: "All that repetition, and no storm! Just a lazy cloud."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438002
    m_Localized: "That bass drags its feet. Shall we give it wheels or a little life?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438003
    m_Localized: "The theme circles like a pigeon inside a harpsichord!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438004
    m_Localized: "That rhythm has reins and spurs! It made me eat dust very precisely."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438005
    m_Localized: "The solo and ensemble contrasted well. They took turns handing me defeat."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438006
    m_Localized: "The refrain returned with fresh energy. I have rather less left."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438007
    m_Localized: "That figuration had spark. It singed my wig and my pride."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438008
    m_Localized: "The bass drove forward tastefully. It need not have driven me off the podium."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438009
    m_Localized: "The texture changed at just the right moment. So did my face."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438010
    m_Localized: "That solo had agility. It dodged my very last protest."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438011
    m_Localized: "I heard real movement. Now I know why victory would not stand still."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438012
    m_Localized: "The repetition generated momentum. My annoyance is still chasing it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438013
    m_Localized: "I admit the ending had brio. I have a very windswept defeat."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438014
    m_Localized: "I won at a gallop! The rival rhythm is still waiting for its bus."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438015
    m_Localized: "The refrain returned to lose again. Now that is consistency!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438016
    m_Localized: "Victory with movement! You may uproot that bass whenever you like."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438017
    m_Localized: "The solo hid so well it could not even find the result."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438018
    m_Localized: "A little contrast brought down that whole lazy cloud!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438019
    m_Localized: "The texture stayed motionless. I left the trophy a prudent distance away."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438020
    m_Localized: "That loop needed a jolt. I gave it an ending!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438021
    m_Localized: "Not a gust of life in the whole solo! Victory came out for fresh air with me."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438022
    m_Localized: "Repetition spun until it got dizzy. I became champion!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438023
    m_Localized: "Concert over! The pigeon may leave the harpsichord."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438024
    m_Localized: "That theme ends before introducing itself with all its titles!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438025
    m_Localized: "The bass promises a giant. All we get is an angry chest of drawers."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438026
    m_Localized: "Where is the harmonic tension? This suspense tastes like a dentist's waiting room."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438027
    m_Localized: "A motif should transform. This one merely changes jackets."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438028
    m_Localized: "They resolved the chord so early the drama was still lacing its boots!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438029
    m_Localized: "All that sonic mist, and no mountain behind it!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438030
    m_Localized: "The voice announces a heroic deed. The accompaniment seems to be looking for parking."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438031
    m_Localized: "That climax is a three-step staircase with ambitions of becoming an altar."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438032
    m_Localized: "A chorus is no inevitable destiny merely because a cymbal announces it!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438033
    m_Localized: "The orchestration puffs out its chest. There is a fairground balloon inside."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438034
    m_Localized: "That tension knew how to sustain itself. My superiority was less stable."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438035
    m_Localized: "The motif transformed powerfully. It stole my victory in another guise!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438036
    m_Localized: "The climax had dramatic weight. It crushed me with every consequence."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438037
    m_Localized: "That bass was imposing. Very well, the chest of drawers had a soul."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438038
    m_Localized: "The resolution kept us waiting wisely. My defeat had less patience."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438039
    m_Localized: "There was continuity between sections. Not a crack for me to escape through!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438040
    m_Localized: "That instrumental colour suggested grandeur. I detest well-founded suggestions."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438041
    m_Localized: "I admit the chorus crowned the journey. I got off without my luggage."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438042
    m_Localized: "The melody had a purpose. Apparently, to dethrone me in tune."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438043
    m_Localized: "That ending had worthy scale. My protest will need a larger stage."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438044
    m_Localized: "Destiny has spoken! And requested more thematic development."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438045
    m_Localized: "That climax fell off its stool. The throne remains far away!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438046
    m_Localized: "I have triumphed! The mist may withdraw: it concealed no epic."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438047
    m_Localized: "The motif changed jackets. Defeat took its measurements."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438048
    m_Localized: "What a hasty resolution! Even disaster demanded a second act."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438049
    m_Localized: "Grandeur would not fit in the loop. Defeat settled in very comfortably."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438050
    m_Localized: "That bass announced giants. They came to collect the furniture."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438051
    m_Localized: "A monumental victory! Save the rising siren for the truck collecting the effects."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438052
    m_Localized: "The chorus demanded a heroic destiny. It was assigned a side exit."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2467484298438053
    m_Localized: "The curtain falls on the purposeless chord! Let no one request an extended mix."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
